*.png
# The app icons are served files, not proof screenshots: they ship.
!public/icons/*.png
# The README's screenshots are product pictures of a staged
# example board with sample cards: they ship too.
!docs/screenshots/*.png
# The front page's board picture is the same staged example
# board, served as a site file: it ships too.
!public/images/*.png
node_modules/
.wrangler/
# One deployment's live settings name that deployment's domain,
# database and people, so the file stays out of the repo. Copy
# wrangler.toml.example to wrangler.toml and fill in your own; the
# deploy workflows write the file from a repository secret when a
# checkout does not have it.
wrangler.toml
.env
# Working notes from local test runs. They can name real accounts
# and boards, so they never ship.
agent-battery.md
e2e-watch-progress.txt

# Rig key material, generated by tests/rig/mkkeys.mjs
tests/rig/jwk.json
tests/rig/private.pem

# The self-host server's real config and its data stay local
server/config.json
server/data/

# The change-digest example keeps one person's board snapshot
# beside the copied script. That file is runtime state, not code.
examples/change-digest/snapshot.json
examples/change-digest/snapshot.json.tmp
